          "description": "Trace blood flow through pulmonary and systemic loops: body \u2192 right atrium \u2192 tricuspid \u2192 right ventricle \u2192 pulmonary valve/arteries \u2192 lungs \u2192 pulmonary veins \u2192 left atrium \u2192 mitral/bicuspid \u2192 left ventricle \u2192 aortic valve/aorta \u2192 body."
